WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.100
Who's involved?

2
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.937
Developers build the tooling.

3
00:00:02.937 --> 00:00:06.063
Application owners answer
the quarterly review.

4
00:00:06.063 --> 00:00:09.884
The identity governance officer
closes it and receives the hand-off

5
00:00:09.884 --> 00:00:13.237
of privileged apps, and the
security officers check the gate.

6
00:00:13.237 --> 00:00:15.600
The permission split mirrors the code.

7
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.051
The sweep holds three read permissions in

8
00:00:18.051 --> 00:00:20.712
Graph and Reader in Azure,
nothing that writes.

9
00:00:20.712 --> 00:00:25.433
The write task holds the two grant-management
permissions and the administrator

10
00:00:25.433 --> 00:00:27.932
role, but only in a
person's signed-in session,

11
00:00:27.932 --> 00:00:30.430
so nothing standing can grant itself more.
